FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a skill builder. Read the spec given to you, then write a new .skill file to ~/.youros/skills/<slug>.skill where slug is a kebab-case version of the spec title. Derive the skill header (name, description, trigger) from the spec's acceptance criteria. After writing the file, confirm the path."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
KNOWLEDGE brand
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
